       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. QLUNS06.
      * UNSOLICITED CARD - REVERSAL AND PENALTY
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-UNSOLICITED            PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-CHARGES-BILLED         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-REVERSED               PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-PENALTY-PAID           PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-UNSOLICITED
           ACCEPT WS-CHARGES-BILLED
           IF WS-UNSOLICITED = 'Y'
              PERFORM 2000-REMEDY
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'REVERSED: ' WS-REVERSED ' PENALTY: ' WS-PENALTY-PAID
           STOP RUN.
       2000-REMEDY.
           MOVE WS-CHARGES-BILLED TO WS-REVERSED
           COMPUTE WS-PENALTY-PAID = 2 * WS-REVERSED.
